  "prefLabel": "Bea 602.15 Incentive",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 602.15 “Incentive” means a monetary form of assistance, support, offset, or the like that motivates or encourages a specific behavior, such as the development of a workforce housing project.\n\nSource. #14044, eff 8-8-24",
